# Secrets for LOCAL `supabase functions serve --env-file supabase/functions/.env`
#
# Copy to `.env` in this directory and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this
# example is not. Nothing here is ever compiled into the app — the whole reason
# the Edge Functions exist is that a key inside an APK is extractable in about
# thirty seconds.

# The one credential that actually gates identification.
# Create at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# NOTE: keys are created with a chosen expiry. The knockabase key lapsed after
# 30 days and every call 401'd at once, which from a phone looks identical to
# "the app is broken". Give this one a long expiry, or diarise the rotation.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional. Defaults to claude-opus-5 — see supabase/functions/_shared/anthropic.ts.
# SILLAGE_MODEL=claude-opus-5
